Height probe oracle hooks for JA2 Stracciatella (Strategy First SFI-SCLA), ja2-node 2026-11-20. See LICENSE (SFI-SCLA).
Lets the shot-flight probe fly bullets and thrown objects frame by frame: appended accessors count the bullets still
flying (Bullets.cc keeps gBullets static), run SimulateObject on every allocated physics slot without the PHYSICSUPDATE
counter and count those slots (Physics.cc keeps ObjectSlots and SimulateObject static). Nothing calls them in the game.
Marks four cosmetic Random draws 4001/4000 in the trace of 0002 (deviation "Cosmetic draws in attacks"): a missile
trail's frame delay, the curse of a merc of ours at a miss, the miss sound of StructureHit and the impact sound of
EVENT_SoldierGotHit. Applied by tools/oracle/build.sh after 0032.

